  m_text: '<b>1  PLACE THE OUTLINE</b>

    Hold the RIGHT GRIP and move the controller
    to match the outline to the real entrance sign/table.


    <b>2  ADJUST THE
    ALIGNMENT</b>

    While holding grip, move the right stick left/right to rotate,
    or up/down to adjust reach. Match the edges and height.


    <b>3  CONFIRM</b>

    Release
    grip, then press A. Wait for the alignment to lock.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ee8e07c22dd1b52448cf41c6ef1233ff, type: 2}
