  m_text: '<b>EXPLORE THE RESTORATION</b>

    After alignment, press A to show/hide
    the model. While it is visible, press B to show/hide site information. Use the
    page buttons to read more.


    <b>REALIGN</b>

    Hold X for two seconds to
    align again.


    <b>RETURN HOME</b>

    Tap X, then tap X again while confirmation
    is visible, or use Home on the tablet.'
