  m_text: '<b>INSPECT A RECONSTRUCTION</b>

    Where available, press Y to enter/leave.
    X also exits. Navigation pauses.


    Grip with either controller to move/turn
    the model. Right stick left/right rotates it; click the stick to reset position,
    rotation and size. Hold B to enlarge; hold A to reduce.


    <b>RETURN TO MENU
    / HOME</b>

    Outside inspection, press X for the tour menu. There, tap X twice
    at confirmation for Home, or use the tablet.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ee8e07c22dd1b52448cf41c6ef1233ff, type: 2}
