  m_text: '<b>EXPLORE THE GALLERY</b>

    Use the left stick to move and the right
    stick to turn. Look for an exhibit''s information icon.


    <b>INSPECT AN ARTIFACT</b>

    Point
    at the information icon and press the index trigger.


    <b>ROTATE AND RESET</b>

    During
    inspection, grip with either controller and turn your hand to rotate. On supported
    exhibits, right stick left/right also rotates; click it to reset position, rotation
    and size.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: ee8e07c22dd1b52448cf41c6ef1233ff, type: 2}
